  "worked_solution": "We use the backward difference approximation formula\n\n$$\n{g}^{\u2032}(x)\u2248\\frac{g(x)-g(x-h)}{h},\n$$\n\n \nat the point $x=4.$ Applying the above formula with $x=4$ and $h=2$ gives \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{g}^{\u2032}(4) & \u2248\\frac{g(4)-g(4-2)}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{g(4)-g(2)}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{5-1}{2} \\\\  & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
